# Play test of The Sunken Archive (CIPlay sunken_archive, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the jetty
# (0.55 m) at the reading room's door on the archive's north face, the reading room (0.5 m), the flooded stacks below
# (floors at -2.55 and -5.6 m, broken windows), the air pocket in the deepest room.
# Quest "Card Catalogue", 10 steps: reading room, letter, shelf box, floor box, the deepest room's air pocket, the vault,
# the keeper, the deep box, the three cards, the vault opened.
island The Sunken Archive
offset 8.6652 1.5661
expect step 0
expect title Card Catalogue

# Along the jetty into the reading room: the archivist's letter
walk -6 0 to -6.5 -6 to -6.5 -9.5 h=0.5
zone readingroom
expect step 1
read Archivist's letter
expect step 2

# The flooded stacks: two card boxes on the upper flooded floor, the third in the deepest room (its air pocket, the
# vault's keeper)
at -6 -14.5 h=-1.4
open Shelf card box
expect step 3
at -3.6 -9.5 h=-1.4
open Floor card box
expect step 4
at -4.5 -14.5 h=-4.4
air deepair
zone vault
expect step 6
kill Angler fish
expect step 7
open Deep card box
expect story card 3
expect step 9
# RAFT2 10-26: Ines Varga, the climb, Binding Cave, the secrets
use Ines Varga
wait 1
expect step 10
expect hidden sa_lampchest
use Reading lamp 1
wait 1
expect shown sa_lampchest
open Ines's bindery box
zone sa_trail
expect step 11
zone sa_summit
expect step 12
open Reading mast deck box
wait 3
zone sa_cave
expect step 13
open Binding Cave chest
wait 3
expect step 14
# the secrets
zone sa_plane
open Book plane's crate
read Book pilot's slip
zone sa_jumps
open Shelver's ledge
open Top of the shelf stack
expect hidden sa_setchest
use sa_piece1
use sa_piece2
use sa_piece3
use sa_piece4
use sa_piece5
wait 2
expect shown sa_setchest
open Ex libris chest

# Up in the reading room: the cards through the index desk; down to the vault
use indexterminal
expect message whirrs
expect story card 0
open Rare book vault
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect done
